xf.map.intro=The marker shows where you are. Drag to move; scroll or use +/- to zoom. Center on you finds your position. Full map zooms out.\n\nClaims use faction colors. Orange is safe zone; red is war zone. Click a claim to see its city name.\n\nStart here opens three short steps. Explore map closes this introduction.
